{
    "title": "JD Sports: Shoes & sneakers",
    "description": "Shop shoes, buy sneakers and get the latest streetwear fashion with the JD Sports app. Get exclusive rewards, deals, offers and updates on when the newest releases are dropping so your wardrobe stays stocked with the freshest fashion. Whether you\u2019re shopping online for casual wear, workout or athletic clothing, we\u2019ve got you covered with stylish fashion to fit your unique style. Shop basketball sneakers or running shoes, mens, womens and kids sports casual wear - you\u2019ll find it all on the app. \r\n\r\nBuy exclusive sports fashion that fits you, from top trending shoes and sneakers, including Jordan or adidas basketball shoes to Nike running shoes and athletic workout gear. \r\n\r\nShopping clothing, shoes & sneakers with JD Sports should be simple. So we\u2019ve made it that way. Always be in the know with the JD Sports mobile app. View your STATUS account and find out every release drop from your favorite brand. Plus, shop the latest sneakers and clothing easily within the app, so it can be yours in seconds.  \r\n\r\nWhat you\u2019ll get with our JD Sports app:\r\n\r\nShopping: See what clothing is trending online and shop the hottest styles from Nike, adidas, Jordan, Yeezy and more. Keep it casual, express yourself in athletic fashion, or show off streetwear to impress - we\u2019ve got style for everyone. \r\n\r\nEasy Checkout: Save your shipping & payment info in the app to speed through checkout every time. Grab those online deals quickly and buy without fuss. \r\n\r\nNew Releases: Keep tabs on fresh drops so you can buy basketball shoes, running shoes, casual sneakers & more in both mens and womens from the hottest brands. Boost your STATUS for exclusive access to events both in-store and digital. No more reservations or waiting in lines. \r\n\r\nFavorites: Mark products as \"favorites\" as you browse so you can easily find them again.\r\n\r\nAlerts: Enable push notifications to stay on top of new releases and exclusive rewards, offers & deals. \r\n\r\nJD Sports is all about the exclusive. We\u2019ve made it easier than ever to shop online for exclusive offers & deals on the latest casual wear, streetwear, basketball sneakers, running shoes, workout gear & more. Buy mens and womens fashion for every mood and style. \r\n\r\nDownload the JD Sports mobile app now for fresh, elite style and exclusive releases & exclusive rewards.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Shop shoes, buy sneakers and get the latest streetwear fashion with the JD Sports app. Get exclusive rewards, deals, offers and updates on when the newest releases are dropping so your wardrobe stays stocked with the freshest fashion. Whether you\u2019re shopping online for casual wear, workout or athletic clothing, we\u2019ve got you covered with stylish fashion to fit your unique style. Shop basketball sneakers or running shoes, mens, womens and kids sports casual wear - you\u2019ll find it all on the app. <br><br>Buy exclusive sports fashion that fits you, from top trending shoes and sneakers, including Jordan or adidas basketball shoes to Nike running shoes and athletic workout gear. <br><br>Shopping clothing, shoes &amp; sneakers with JD Sports should be simple. So we\u2019ve made it that way. Always be in the know with the JD Sports mobile app. View your STATUS account and find out every release drop from your favorite brand. Plus, shop the latest sneakers and clothing easily within the app, so it can be yours in seconds.  <br><br>What you\u2019ll get with our JD Sports app:<br><br>Shopping: See what clothing is trending online and shop the hottest styles from Nike, adidas, Jordan, Yeezy and more. Keep it casual, express yourself in athletic fashion, or show off streetwear to impress - we\u2019ve got style for everyone. <br><br>Easy Checkout: Save your shipping &amp; payment info in the app to speed through checkout every time. Grab those online deals quickly and buy without fuss. <br><br>New Releases: Keep tabs on fresh drops so you can buy basketball shoes, running shoes, casual sneakers &amp; more in both mens and womens from the hottest brands. Boost your STATUS for exclusive access to events both in-store and digital. No more reservations or waiting in lines. <br><br>Favorites: Mark products as &quot;favorites&quot; as you browse so you can easily find them again.<br><br>Alerts: Enable push notifications to stay on top of new releases and exclusive rewards, offers &amp; deals. <br><br>JD Sports is all about the exclusive. We\u2019ve made it easier than ever to shop online for exclusive offers &amp; deals on the latest casual wear, streetwear, basketball sneakers, running shoes, workout gear &amp; more. Buy mens and womens fashion for every mood and style. <br><br>Download the JD Sports mobile app now for fresh, elite style and exclusive releases &amp; exclusive rewards.",
